    "details": "<h3>Welcome to the PROJECT : ECLIPSE - AI &amp; Automation Hackathon - by Genie X Hub</h3>\n<p>An online hackathon focused on AI and automation.</p>\n<h4>About the Opportunity:</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>PROJECT : ECLIPSE - AI &amp; Automation Hackathon is an online coding challenge organized by Genie X Hub , Chennai. It offers teams an opportunity to participate in a focused hackathon experience centered on artificial intelligence and automation.</li>\n<li>Bring your team together, engage with coding, and explore the possibilities of AI and automation through an online challenge designed for collaborative participation.</li>\n<li>Take the next step with your team and participate in PROJECT : ECLIPSE - AI &amp; Automation Hackathon&nbsp; by Genie X Hub, Chennai.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000; font-weight: 600;\">Screening Round - Idea Submission</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Participants are required to submit their AI- based solution idea.</li>\n<li>Submission will be evaluated based on innovation, problem understanding, AI utilization, technical feasibility, and potential rael-world impact. Shortlisted teams will advance to the next round.</li>\n</ul>",
